OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for 'exciting' museum refurb
OL,4,Aset for approval
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to carry out a refurbishment of
OL,7,FRutland County Museum in a bid to turn
OL,8,Fit into a "first-class visitor
OL,9,Fattraction" are set to be given the go
OL,10,Fahead.
OL,12,FRutland County Council is recommended
OL,13,Fto approve a planning application to
OL,14,Frevamp the attraction in Oakham on
OL,15,FTuesday.
OL,17,FAccording to planning documents, the
OL,18,Fproject would involve an extension to
OL,19,Fthe museum to provide additional
OL,20,Fexhibition space, a multipurpose hall,
OL,21,Fcafe and visitor facilities.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
